# The Planetary Council's window (CouncWin, see src/ui/councwin.c): the Abstain button (id 3: the vote -3, which takes no part in the count)
# and the popups of a click on a seat cancelled with Escape (nothing is bought). On a proposal with a yea and a nay (council_p2 after
# votes_two): a click on a seat asks yea or nay and Escape cancels it; the Abstain button votes, the vote is decided on the AIs' yeas
# alone, and Escape closes the window, which carries the proposal out. Then the election of a governor: a click on a seat opens the list
# of the candidates, and Escape cancels it. The state regions are as in councwin_vote.scene.
# Leave time after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
